[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4562.55, "timestamp": "01:16:02", "text": "周边产品，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4565.35, "timestamp": "01:16:05", "text": "但是因为创作瓶颈，我不得不暂停音乐创作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4567.99, "timestamp": "01:16:07", "text": "。 我当时正在探索其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4570.55, "timestamp": "01:16:10", "text": "创作途径。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4573.03, "timestamp": "01:16:13", "text": "我就是这样开始接触艺术的。 尝试过游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4576.47, "timestamp": "01:16:16", "text": "设计方面的东西。 虚幻引擎相关的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4579.03, "timestamp": "01:16:19", "text": "内容。 混合，而不是搅拌机。 对，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4595.91, "timestamp": "01:16:35", "text": "呃，但是呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4598.79, "timestamp": "01:16:38", "text": "你知道，对我来说，呃，因为呃，因为你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4602.39, "timestamp": "01:16:42", "text": "祖先在写作，对吧？ 是《月光》的作者，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4604.63, "timestamp": "01:16:44", "text": "对吧？ 你知道，我本科读的是英国"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4607.43, "timestamp": "01:16:47", "text": "文学，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4610.149, "timestamp": "01:16:50", "text": "因为我觉得这是最容易"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4612.31, "timestamp": "01:16:52", "text": "拿到的学位，因为它跟英语有关。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4615.35, "timestamp": "01:16:55", "text": "而且，你还能学习莎士比亚之类的知识，从而成为一名作家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4617.03, "timestamp": "01:16:57", "text": "，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4618.31, "timestamp": "01:16:58", "text": "对吧？"}]